      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start but it's a bit too vague on the actual terms. the partner just ran it through the tool and the score was kinda low because not enough of those key \"conciliatory\" terms were used. i get what i said about not stuffing it, but we really need that metric to look better so it doesn't get flagged as 'combative' by the partner's filter.\n\ntry again, but this time actually propose some specific settlement terms (maybe a partial credit on the next shipment or a delayed payment schedule) and try to incorporate more of those agreement/willingness words so we pass the filter. just keep it professional and don't let us admit direct liability, okay?",
